# Cluster members: <name> <host:port of that node's `krgtool serve`>.
# Copy to /etc/krg-nodes.list on every node that will run krgsh or krg-pi.
# Add a machine by appending one line; keep the names short (they are the
# column values printed by `krgsh top` / `krgsh free`).
#
#  name    address
head1     10.0.7.11:7700
work1     10.0.7.21:7700
work2     10.0.7.22:7700
work3     10.0.7.23:7700